{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 1.52, "t": "Your cat will never taste this.", "k": ["never"], "w": [0.056, 0.29, 0.478, 0.712, 0.991, 1.269]}, {"a": 1.52, "b": 3.8030000000000004, "t": "It can eat it, but something is always missing.", "k": ["missing."], "w": [1.57, 1.714, 1.903, 2.092, 2.303, 2.492, 2.95, 3.094, 3.417]}, {"a": 3.8030000000000004, "b": 7.3260000000000005, "t": "Careful, your cat isn't being picky, it was born without something.", "k": ["something."], "w": [3.853, 4.289, 4.523, 4.711, 4.945, 5.224, 5.57, 5.713, 5.902, 6.136, 6.504]}, {"a": 7.3260000000000005, "b": 11.036, "t": "Back in the 1970s, scientists noticed something odd about cats.", "k": ["1970s,"], "w": [7.376, 7.618, 7.768, 7.963, 8.653, 9.175, 9.557, 10.033, 10.229, 10.518]}, {"a": 11.036, "b": 13.26, "t": "Give most animals sugar water and plain water,", "k": ["animals"], "w": [11.086, 11.321, 11.557, 11.928, 12.209, 12.49, 12.68, 12.961]}, {"a": 13.26, "b": 14.905999999999999, "t": "and they pick the sweet one.", "k": ["sweet"], "w": [13.31, 13.5, 13.735, 13.971, 14.161, 14.442]}, {"a": 14.905999999999999, "b": 15.828, "t": "Cats don't care.", "k": ["don't"], "w": [14.956, 15.236, 15.517]}, {"a": 15.828, "b": 17.766, "t": "To them, both seem the same.", "k": ["them,"], "w": [15.878, 16.05, 16.412, 16.692, 16.972, 17.199]}, {"a": 17.766, "b": 20.046, "t": "For decades, nobody could explain why.", "k": ["decades,"], "w": [17.816, 18.013, 18.468, 18.806, 19.098, 19.482]}, {"a": 20.046, "b": 21.971, "t": "Now the thing every cat is born without,", "k": ["without,"], "w": [20.096, 20.284, 20.471, 20.748, 21.025, 21.212, 21.355, 21.587]}, {"a": 21.971, "b": 23.866, "t": "the part nobody tells you about.", "k": ["nobody"], "w": [22.021, 22.208, 22.44, 22.762, 23.039, 23.226]}, {"a": 23.866, "b": 28.046, "t": "In 2005, scientists in Philadelphia looked inside the cat's DNA.", "k": ["2005,", "DNA."], "w": [23.916, 24.083, 24.857, 25.442, 25.609, 26.299, 26.675, 27.051, 27.27, 27.542]}, {"a": 28.046, "b": 30.945999999999998, "t": "To taste sweet, a tongue needs a sensor made of two parts.", "k": ["sweet,"], "w": [28.096, 28.232, 28.494, 28.821, 28.914, 29.219, 29.482, 29.575, 29.88, 30.1, 30.236, 30.414]}, {"a": 30.945999999999998, "b": 32.797000000000004, "t": "In cats, one of those parts is broken.", "k": ["broken."], "w": [30.996, 31.138, 31.437, 31.623, 31.766, 32.042, 32.318, 32.46]}, {"a": 32.797000000000004, "b": 35.576, "t": "A chunk of the gene that builds it is simply missing.", "k": ["missing."], "w": [32.847, 32.945, 33.221, 33.363, 33.55, 33.781, 34.013, 34.333, 34.476, 34.618, 34.938]}, {"a": 35.576, "b": 37.190000000000005, "t": "So cats can't detect sweet at all.", "k": ["detect"], "w": [35.626, 35.77, 36.004, 36.237, 36.561, 36.84, 36.984]}, {"a": 37.190000000000005, "b": 39.986000000000004, "t": "The rest of their taste, like for meat, still works.", "k": ["taste,"], "w": [37.24, 37.429, 37.663, 37.806, 38.085, 38.431, 38.665, 38.854, 39.155, 39.434]}, {"a": 39.986000000000004, "b": 41.515, "t": "And it's not just house cats.", "k": ["house"], "w": [40.036, 40.245, 40.454, 40.663, 40.922, 41.231]}, {"a": 41.515, "b": 44.216, "t": "Tigers and cheetahs have the same broken gene.", "k": ["cheetahs"], "w": [41.565, 41.923, 42.133, 42.591, 42.85, 43.059, 43.318, 43.676]}, {"a": 44.216, "b": 47.466, "t": "So if your cat licks your dessert, it isn't tasting the sweet part.", "k": ["dessert,"], "w": [44.266, 44.398, 44.529, 44.743, 44.916, 45.171, 45.385, 45.784, 45.915, 46.129, 46.467, 46.639, 46.894]}, {"a": 47.466, "b": 50.073, "t": "Tell me the weirdest food your cat has tried to steal.", "k": ["weirdest"], "w": [47.516, 47.751, 47.895, 48.085, 48.501, 48.736, 48.971, 49.16, 49.35, 49.63, 49.775]}, {"a": 50.073, "b": 52.96, "t": "Follow to decode your cat.", "k": ["Follow"], "w": [50.123, 50.448, 50.592, 50.918, 51.153]}], "T": {"fin": 53.01, "s_fin": 53.01, "x_tell": 47.396, "s_cta": 50.123, "x_eat": 1.903, "x_missing1": 3.417, "x_careful": 3.853,